'''Coco''' (ココ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[LINE Pokopang! Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Coco
|image = E 401.png
|appearance = [[LINE Pokopang! Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Coco fulfills the status role of the Pokopang group, as he has a guaranteed chance to weaken your Cat Units. Coco's weaken duration lasts for 100 frames and Coco attacks every 97 frames, so it is possible for cats to get stuck in a weaken lock if they are not knocked back. At his highest strength ([[Rainbow Blast!]] at 3 crown difficulty), he has 240,000 health and 20,000 attack power.

==Strategy==
Stacking [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]] is sufficient for dealing with Coco if he is alone, because King Dragon Cat outranges him and has enough firepower for the job. A level 60 King Dragon Cat will kill a 200% Coco in twenty hits if protected. But if [[Pokota (Enemy)|Pokota]] is also present, then it may be better to have a heavy-hitting cat like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] occupy the backline instead.

